{
  "id": "unique-event-036",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-036:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#36 - Witch’s knots\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,22,42]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-036:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The cord has d6+1 knots. You may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,42,75]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-036:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "undo one knot to reroll one die at\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,75,110]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-036:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "any point of the game, as a free\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,110,143]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-036:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "action. However, every time to do\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,143,177]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-036:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "so, roll d6. If the total is lower than\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,177,217]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-036:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the number of knots you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,217,246]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-036:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "undone so far, you lose 1 Sanity.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,246,280]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-036:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "When the last knot is undone, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,280,314]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-036:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll for the last time and the cord\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,314,350]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-036:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "loses its powers.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[93,350,368]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    93
  ]
}
